        <div id="comparison" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">7. How It Compares</h2>
        <p>
          The Pro 2000 doesn't exist in a vacuum — here's how it stacks up
          against the NordicTrack machine it's most often cross-shopped
          against, and the ProForm model directly below it.
        </p>
