            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Treating the first-year iFit as permanent</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">iFit is included for a year and renews after. As with every machine in this family, decide whether you want the hardware or the subscription before the renewal arrives.</p>
