            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Skipping the break-in period</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">The first 20 miles seat the belt and deck. Owners who start with speed work in week one are disproportionately represented in reports of belt slip and uneven tracking.</p>
